<title>CANADA: Denison says Standard Trust suit dropped.</title>
<headline>Denison says Standard Trust suit dropped.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denison Mines Ltd said on Wednesday that a lawsuit against the company involving Standard Trust Co 's operations has been discontinued.</p>
<p>The lawsuit was launched by Ernst &amp; Young Inc, the liquidator of Standard Trust, and by Canada Deposit Insurance Corp, Denison said in a statement.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
